  {
    "id": 3007004020070,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "あ、結華！",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300700402/3007004020070"
  },
  {
    "id": 3007004020080,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "なんね、結華は王子なうちが気に入ったと？\r\n霧子もおるし、また見せちゃろっか？",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300700402/3007004020080"
  },
  {
    "id": 3007004020090,
    "speaker": "霧子",
    "text": "お、王子様……？",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "kiriko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300700402/3007004020090"
  },
  {
    "id": 3007004020100,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "楽しそうだけど、また次の機会にとっておこうかな～\r\nそれよりさ、ふたりは揃ってお出かけ？　デート？",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300700402/3007004020100"
  },
  {
    "id": 3007004020110,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "そうたい！　今日は霧子とお茶してたとよ！\r\nこれから買い物もする予定ばい！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300700402/3007004020110"
  },
  {
    "id": 3007004020120,
    "speaker": "霧子",
    "text": "う、うん……そうなんだけど……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLabel": "kiriko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300700402/3007004020120"
  },
  {
    "id": 3007004020130,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "何かお困りだったり？\r\nさっきもあわあわしてたっぽかったけど",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300700402/3007004020130"
  },
  {
    "id": 3007004020140,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "うちらの心配してくれたん？　優しかねぇ\r\nでも問題なかよ！　別に、困っとるってほどじゃなかと",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300700402/3007004020140"
  },
  {
    "id": 3007004020150,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "ちょっとここがどこなのかわからんだけたい！",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300700402/3007004020150"
  },
  {
    "id": 3007004020160,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "なるほどねぇ、こがたんってばポジティブ～！\r\n……ちなみにきりりん、どこ行こうとしてたの？",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300700402/3007004020160"
  },
  {
    "id": 3007004020170,
    "speaker": "霧子",
    "text": "あ、えっと……本屋さんに、行きたくて……",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "kiriko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300700402/3007004020170"
  },
  {
    "id": 3007004020180,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "霧子、病院の患者さんたちにおつかい頼まれてたらしか\r\nそん中に普通の本屋じゃ売っとらんものもあって",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300700402/3007004020180"
  },
  {
    "id": 3007004020190,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "やけん、新しいお店ば探しとるところたい！\r\nうちの勘では、もうすぐ着くと思うんやけど～",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300700402/3007004020190"
  },
  {
    "id": 3007004020200,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "ははぁ、冒険の途中だったってわけですか\r\nだったらその旅、三峰も仲間に入れてよ",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300700402/3007004020200"
  },
  {
    "id": 3007004020210,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "王子と姫と、優秀な道案内\r\nバランスのいいパーティだと思わない？",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300700402/3007004020210"
  },
  {
    "id": 3007004020220,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "おおっ、それは心強かね～！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300700402/3007004020220"
  },
  {
    "id": 3007004020230,
    "speaker": "霧子",
    "text": "ふふ、うん……！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "kiriko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300700402/3007004020230"
  },
  {
    "id": 3007004020240,
    "speaker": "霧子",
    "text": "本のリストを……預かってて……\r\n結華ちゃん、これでわかるかな……？",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
